      "side": 1,
      "message": "There were a couple of other issues we discussed with the PD WG that we should make sure work in our code: \n- We should never Vconn swap, but we also shouldn\u0027t consider ourselves the \"vconn source\" of the connection with the port partner\n- We should probably maintain Vconn through hard resets",
